# Deterministic Spine Architecture

## Problem
System has ~60% deterministic infrastructure but 100% of "peak intelligence" = LLM reasoning. Decomposition engine exists (decomposer, micro-query generator, fact assembler, template evolver, gap analyzer, stage0 bridge) but is NOT wired into stage0 main flow. stage0.md has ZERO references to decomposition.

## Key Discovery
More exists than initially thought:
- `template_evolver.py` — already tracks per-template metrics + evolves weights (10% cap)
- `dimension_registry.py` — already has `benchmark_comparison` in QUESTION_TYPE_DIMENSIONS
- `query_classifier.py` — already extracts person names, ages, roles, industries
- `stage0_bridge.py` — already has `pre_decompose()` + `pre_analyze()` methods
- `founder-profile.json` — exists but metaphysics-only, no skills/capital/network

