## Architecture (Before vs After)

### Before
```
User Query → [stage0.md: 2500 lines of LLM prompt] → LLM reasons everything → Output
```

### After
```
User Query
  → [QueryClassifier] classify (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [DimensionRegistry] select dimensions (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [MicroQueryGenerator] generate 40-50 micro-queries (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [AtomicResolver] resolve from local KB (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [MicroQueryRunner] fire remaining via LLM (LLM: micro, constrained)
  → [FactAssembler] verify + deduplicate + store (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [TemplateEvolver] record metrics + evolve (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [GapAnalyzer] with FounderCapabilities (DETERMINISTIC)
  → [stage0.md agents] reason ONLY from pre-verified facts (LLM: structured)
  → [SynthesisConstraint] validate citations (DETERMINISTIC)
  → Output
```

